01:27:15,440 --> 01:27:19,040
And that could literally be a big enough market for you, especially as an indie or something.

1003
01:27:19,280 --> 01:27:20,800
So yeah, it's it's super weird.

1004
01:27:21,680 --> 01:27:26,720
Yeah, it's super weird because as a developer, you really want the right answer.

1005
01:27:27,040 --> 01:27:28,880
You want to know what's the right answer to this.

1006
01:27:29,120 --> 01:27:35,200
